[00:00.26]Conor Maynard - Someone You Loved\r\n[00:03.27]Lyrics by：Benjamin Kohn、Lewis Capaldi、Pete Kelleher、Sam Roman、Tom Barnes\r\n[00:03.84]Composed by：Benjamin Kohn、Lewis Capaldi、Pete Kelleher、Sam Roman、Tom Barnes\r\n[00:09.20]I'm going under and I fear this time there's no one to save me\r\n[00:17.83]This all or nothing really got a way of driving me crazy\r\n[00:24.42]I need somebody to heal somebody to know\r\n[00:29.40]Somebody to have somebody to hold\r\n[00:33.70]It's easy to say but it's never the same\r\n[00:38.06]I guess I kinda liked the way you numbed all the pain\r\n[00:42.16]And now the day bleeds into nightfall\r\n[00:46.52]And you're not here to get me through it all\r\n[00:50.85]I let my guard down and you pulled the rug\r\n[00:55.31]I was getting kinda used to being someone you loved\r\n[01:01.54]I'm going under and I fear this time there's no one to turn to\r\n[01:10.21]This all or nothing way of loving got me sleeping without you\r\n[01:16.66]Now I need somebody to know somebody to heal\r\n[01:21.74]Somebody to have just to know how it feels\r\n[01:26.05]It's easy to say but it's never the same\r\n[01:30.42]I guess I kinda like the way you help me escape\r\n[01:34.48]And now the day bleeds into nightfall\r\n[01:38.92]And you're not here to get me through it all\r\n[01:43.15]I let my guard down and you pulled the rug\r\n[01:47.65]I was getting kinda used to being someone you loved\r\n[01:51.79]And now the day bleeds into nightfall\r\n[01:56.32]And you're not here to get me through it all\r\n[02:00.56]I let my guard down and you pulled the rug\r\n[02:05.11]I was getting kinda used to being someone you loved\r\n